export anchor CandyDarkStyle:
    number: 279
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Candy dark
    idea: Chunky candy pieces on a dark plum tray, fat rounded file cards with bright sweet coloured blobs, gummy pill tabs and buttons that sit up on a little 3D ledge.
    base: dark
    palette:
        plum: #1f1024, the page, fields and fact tiles
        tray: #2c1533, the top bar, file cards, details and the style sheet
        chew: #3b1d44, size chips, secondary buttons and the jelly frame
        ink: #fff4fb, text
        muted: #dcc6e2, meta and labels
        darkPlum: #2a0f2f, text and icons on every candy fill
        bubblegum: #ff7ac6, the primary button, the PDF blob, the selected border, Selected and storage stripes
        lime: #b9f56c, the current tab and sheet headings
        sky: #72d6ff, the pressed switch, links, the image blob and Shared
        lemon: #ffe36b, folder blobs, Starred and the focus ring
        tangerine: #ffa45c, the archive blob and Uploading
        grape: #c3a0ff, the document blob
    type:
        One rounded stack, ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded, Nunito, Varela Round,
        Arial Rounded MT Bold, in heavy weights. The folder title is 40px at
        800, the details name 22px, file names 17px at 800, meta 13px at
        600, buttons 15px at 800, status pills 13px at 800.
    layout:
        A rounded top bar on the tray holds a pink candy B tile with Drive,
        pill tabs for My files, Shared with me, Recent, Starred and Trash
        with My files in lime on a green ledge, and a pill Search files
        field. Below sit the breadcrumb in sky links, the title Website
        redesign, and on the right Upload, New folder and a List or Grid
        switch with List in sky. The board has two columns. The list is
        eight chunky cards with 24px corners, each with a 56px candy blob
        for the type, lemon circles for folders, bubblegum for the PDF,
        sky for the image, lime for the sheet, grape for the document,
        tangerine for the archive and a domed bubblegum blob for the video.
        Next come the name, kind, date and person, candy status pills and a
        size chip on the right. The selected card has a 3px bubblegum
        border. Uploading adds a candy striped tangerine bar. A 330px
        details panel with 32px corners holds a wobbly jelly frame around
        the preview, the name, Starred, four fact tiles, Share, Download
        and Get link, and a storage tile with a striped bubblegum bar and
        64.2 GB of 100 GB used. A few sprinkles lie on the tray. Below
        1040px details drop under the list. Below 700px the size chip moves
        under the name.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px between cards, 16 to 20px card padding, 24px between list and details.
    density: Roomy and chunky. Big blobs and 17px names.
    corners: Very round. 24px cards, 28 to 32px bars and panels, pills for every control, a wobbly jelly frame.
    borders: Mostly none. 3px bubblegum on the selected card and 3px chew rings on fields.
    shadows: Solid 4px ledges under buttons and the current tab, inset highlights and shades on blobs.
    icons:
        2.2px rounded line icons in dark plum on candy blobs. Status is a
        candy pill with dark text, a lemon pill with a star for Starred, a
        sky pill with two heads for Shared, a tangerine pill with an up
        arrow for Uploading and a bubblegum pill with a checked box for
        Selected.
    focus: A 3px lemon outline offset 3px.
    tone: Friendly and short, such as Drive, Details and Upload.
